    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for backends that support low-bit quantised inference. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Inherits <ref refid="classthemis_1_1acceleration_1_1_i_compute_backend" kindref="compound">IComputeBackend</ref> capabilities and adds quantise/dequantise primitives, a quantised matrix multiply, and a calibration pass for post-training quantisation (PTQ).</para>
<para>Thread safety: implementations must document their own thread-safety guarantees. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
